    web_render_nowrap_lead_space_after_space_not_collapsed_2026-11-27, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep-20261127 (nowrap lead-space collapse: sole-#text nowrap inline drops its collapsible lead space from box width, wrap ranges, raster and Draw IR slices); inline_nowrap_lead_space_collapse_spec 3/3 PASS 2026-11-27. Was: web render: a nowrap run's leading space is not collapsed after a space", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_engine.spl, 4749, NONE, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true

