    web_render_nowrap_lead_space_after_space_not_collapsed_2026-11-27, fixing, p3sweep-20261127, 2026-11-27T12:02:43Z, 2026-11-27T12:02:43Z, open, "wave3"

    web_render_nowrap_lead_space_after_space_not_collapsed_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: reproduced per SDN record repro (x + nowrap-span lead space + follower): pre-fix follower at 21 vs Chrome 20, span box w=11 holding the space; post-fix w=7, follower at 17 across all font-resolution states with ink probes confirming identical y glyph paint. Root cause: lead-space collapse charge skipped white-space:nowrap runs and nowrap runs were measured over raw text (layout_engine.spl ~4952; core :1581). Fix: drop the lead space advance from the predicted width and hand the px to layout_with_style via new pending global g_text_nowrap_lead_collapse_pending (layout_engine + layout_foundation + paint_draw_ir wrap_line_starts slice). New spec test/01_unit/browser_engine/inline_nowrap_lead_space_collapse_spec.spl 3/3 PASS (collapse + sabotage control within 1px, b-element twin, no-preceding-space control survives). Neighbours inline_pen_collapsed_space 6/6, pre_newlines_and_overflow_wrap 9/9, block_margin_before_anonymous_inline_run 7/7 PASS. Residual: line-start nowrap lead space and rtl nowrap paths unchanged (pre-existing/separate). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/inline_nowrap_lead_space_collapse_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/inline_pen_collapsed_space_spec.spl"
